# EXPECT-SUBSTRING: bang bieu thuc chuoi
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# Gan lai local kieu int bang bieu thuc CHUOI PHAI bi tu choi.
#
# Truoc khi sua (2026-09-30): `x = 1` roi `x = "abc"` bien dich THANH CONG,
# chay THANH CONG, exit code 0 - va `str(x)` in ra CHUOI RONG. Mat hoan toan
# gia tri ma khong bao gi. Lenh `ldstr` cua chuoi bi day vao slot 4 byte cua
# local i32 nen doc ra rong.
#
# Python cho phep doi kieu dong bien; TokenVector khong, va do la gioi han
# hop le - nhung phai noi RO, khong duoc im lang cho ra gia tri rac.
def run() -> "i32":
    x = 1
    x = "abc"
    print(str(x))
    return 0
